--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 0.3.3-beta.2 — automatic diagnostic session reports
+
+- Keep a separate, complete `session.log` for each PadBridge run, flushed as events occur and finalized on clean shutdown; preserve the previous run as `previous-session.log` on the next launch.
+- Record when the browser control panel is closed or navigated away from (best-effort browser `pagehide` notification).
+- Add current-session and previous-session report downloads to the web control panel; the existing rolling log and live log view remain available.
+- Logging continues during runtime, so unexpected termination preserves the report up to the last flushed event.
+
+
 ## 0.3.3-beta.1 — responsive PadBridge control panel
 
 - Kept the existing on-console and browser-based control panel as the single GUI for PS5, phone, tablet, and desktop use.
